            "text": "EXT. CANAL WALK - EVENING"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "16676de7-0dd4-5dbc-9b2f-1cc2416ca5fc",
        "kind": "Action",
        "spans": [
          {
            "text": "A courier runs along the south bank toward a footbridge. Her pursuer follows twenty paces behind. The bridge is closed by a locked gate. She sees a low service boat drifting under it, jumps down onto its roof, and disappears beneath the bridge. The pursuer reaches the locked gate and sees her emerge on the north bank."
          }
        ]
      }
