        "id": "3f1f616f-3068-5c3d-b4be-6bda7a462172",
        "kind": "Action",
        "spans": [
          {
            "text": "Ada sits opposite a stranger whose gloves hide his hands. He reaches for his ticket, exposing a crescent scar. Ada recognises it but keeps her expression calm."
